# Emblazoned Golem's "Spend only colored mana on X" (PlaySpellAbility.java:
# 459-461): kicked for X = 2 with four colorless mana, its {2} can be paid
# but the X units, each a colored shard, cannot, so the cast is refused;
# unkicked it is cast for {2}.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 C
tapformana human 3 C
tapformana human 4 C
tapformana human 5 C
queue confirmpaycost true
queue payx 2
queue hybridmanacolor W
queue hybridmanacolor U
queue paygeneric C
queue paygeneric C
expecterror refused castspell human 1
queue confirmpaycost false
queue paygeneric C
queue paygeneric C
castspell human 1
resolvestack
